# The portal project (Root Directory `app`). This file exists so that Vercel uses it
# instead of falling back to the repository-root .vercelignore, which is the marketing
# site's public-surface allowlist (SPEC-017) and would strip the portal's build inputs.
# The portal is a Next.js build: nothing here is served as a raw file.
.env*
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules
.next
